  "type": "multiple-choice",
  "originalQuery": "You are tasked with managing a Cloud SQL for MySQL database that will support an application with a global user base. The application requires low-latency read operations and the ability to scale read capacity on demand. What should you do to optimize read performance across multiple regions?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Enable automatic storage increase on the Cloud SQL instance to improve read performance.<br/>B. Utilize a Content Delivery Network (CDN) to cache read operations close to the users.<br/>C. Set up a Cloud Spanner instance to handle global distribution and read-write operations.<br/>D. Configure the Cloud SQL instance for MySQL with read replicas in each target region.",
  "domain": "Deploy scalable and highly available databases in Google Cloud",
  "hasImage": false,
